OL,3,GNEWSADriver admits killing pedestrian
OL,4,Ain police chase
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has pleaded guilty to causing the
OL,7,Fdeath of woman who was hit by a car
OL,8,Fduring a police pursuit.
OL,10,FKvD[toslava Horvathova, 36, was killed
OL,11,Fwhen she was struck by a black Vauxhall
OL,12,FCorsa, in Beckett Street, Leeds, while
OL,13,Fit was being followed by police on 29
OL,14,FOctober.
OL,16,FOn Friday, Harry Gyamsie-Perah, 19, of
OL,17,FColdcotes Garth, Leeds, admitted
OL,18,Fcausing her death by dangerous driving.
OL,19,FHe will be sentenced at Leeds Crown
OL,20,FCourt on 15 January.
OL,23,APub: 27-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
